WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.400
Current is the flow of free electrons, pushed round by the battery.

2
00:00:05.076 --> 00:00:09.851
The red plusses are fixed atoms. The blue minuses are free electrons.

3
00:00:10.627 --> 00:00:14.352
The battery pushes the electrons round. They are not used up.

4
00:00:19.353 --> 00:00:23.153
Fewer volts: a weaker push, a slower drift, a dimmer bulb.
